# [Seq.Cons p] pattern: destructure a Seq.Cons, access head via p.head.
# T-1154: [Seq h t] no longer binds h/t (Pattern::Pin — wildcard, no binding).
# Regression: Pattern::Constructor("Seq.Cons") must match Value::Variant{Seq.Cons}.
[match [range 42 46]
  [case [let p] [Seq.Cons p] p.head]
  _:                         0]
=== out
Int(42)
